(4) lattice deviation floor: delta_lat = beta_hat (k a)^2  =>  k a = sqrt(floor/beta_hat);  wavelength lambda/a = 2 pi/(k a);  phi^3-inflation steps above the lattice scale n = ln(lambda/a)/ln(phi^3)
